WEBVTT

40:01.217 --> 40:03.260
He'd have to leave home.

40:04.553 --> 40:06.931
He'd have to leave me.

40:07.932 --> 40:10.059
And so would you.

40:10.184 --> 40:12.520
You left your home to come here.

40:12.645 --> 40:14.397
And I'd be queen someday.

40:16.357 --> 40:17.900
Please make Father say yes!

40:18.025 --> 40:19.819
- Sansa...
- Please, please!

40:19.944 --> 40:22.822
It's the only thing I ever wanted.

40:26.867 --> 40:28.953
(MUSIC PLAYING, PEOPLE CHATTERING)
